    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "\u00d3scar Ra\u00f1a, Spanish illustrator and animator, based Galicia (Pontevedra; studied at Universidad de Vigo). Experimental, geometric, comics-influenced work spanning illustration and animation, so tagged Illustration plus 3D & motion. Co-founded RAPAPAWN, an experimental animation and design studio, with artist Cynthia Alfonso; their work (music videos, visual loops, editorial) has been featured by AIGA Eye on Design and It's Nice That and made for clients like Brooklyn venue Elsewhere. Mid-level independent artist/illustrator running his own small studio; autonomy 4. Work Status Studio: operates through his own RAPAPAWN (rapapawn.com) rather than as a freelancer-for-hire or employee. IG handle @oscaranha matches his name; no separate personal website found beyond the studio site.",
